          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngikagumak a ngimalea a amod kesi ejwoko alotunga a Kedar, nakaneni tani ngulu, ekidiekuunete lu idongete. Alimu ayong Ekapolon Akuj na arai Akuj a Isirael nguna.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.17"
            ]
          }
